      "extract": "RIGIDITY, RESIDUES AND DUALITY: OVERVIEW AND RECENT PROGRESS AMNON YEKUTIELI Abstract. In this article we explain the theory of rigid residue complexes in commutative algebra and algebraic geometry, summarizing the background, recent results and antic- ipated future results. Unlike all previous approaches to Grothendieck Duality, the rigid approach concentrates on the construction of rigid residue complexes over",
