      "extract": "This article is about the {\\em rigid approach to Grothendieck Duality} (GD). We survey the main features of this approach, discussing both results that were already obtained, and future expected results. Throughout this article we work over a fixed base ring $\\K$, which is a finite dimensional regular noetherian commutative ring (e.g.\\ a field or the ring of integers $\\Z$). All rings are commutative $\\K$-rings, and",
